# BULGARIAN SPLIT SQUAT

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Bulgarian Split Squat is a unilateral lower-body compound exercise designed to develop strength, stability and force production through a split stance.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the highest-transfer unilateral strength exercises for combat athletes.

---

# Philosophy

Combat rarely occurs with both feet perfectly aligned.

The Bulgarian Split Squat develops force production in asymmetric positions while simultaneously improving balance, stability and lower-body coordination.

CAS selects this exercise whenever unilateral force production provides greater transfer than bilateral loading.

