# Scientific Evidence

Evidence Level

★★★★★

The Bulgarian Split Squat is strongly supported for improving unilateral strength, lower-body stability, inter-limb symmetry and athletic performance while reducing spinal loading compared with heavy bilateral exercises.

---

# Explainability

Example

The Bulgarian Split Squat is selected because combat athletes rarely produce force from perfectly symmetrical positions.

Improving unilateral strength and stability enhances striking, acceleration, deceleration and change-of-direction performance while reducing asymmetries between limbs.

